SQSM research implementation, 2026-10-13.

This distribution is a substantially modified derivative project based on a
local copy of SoftCoT, Github: xuyige/SoftCoT, commit
fa7f537d1d0affa430851315edf68746d410b59c.

The original files are preserved in baselines/softcot. New SQSM code replaces
the assistant-model architecture with question memory, state-dependent reading,
bounded residual injection, weighted training and request-local cached decoding.
The root README has been fully replaced. Existing upstream license notices are
preserved, including the upstream non-commercial restrictions in LICENSE.

No original baseline authorship is claimed for the new SQSM implementation.
